  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture and Markets Support Program: The purpose of the AMS activity is to increase the supply of quality, toxin-free grain for humanitarian assistance and for sale in local markets, and help farmers take a more commercial approach to agriculture and thereby increase their income.</narrative>
  </description>
